<main id="main"><section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Toronto skyline and CN Tower across Lake Ontario in golden evening light" width="1800" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Destination management & event transportation</p><h1 id="hero-title">Extraordinary places.<br><span>Exceptionally planned.</span></h1><p class="hero-copy">Corporate events, incentive travel and private group experiences. Curated, planned and delivered by Travaza.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#enquire">Discuss your brief</a><a class="button ghost" href="#destinations">Discover the destinations</a></div></div><div class="hero-caption"><span>Toronto · Niagara Falls · Canada · Worldwide</span><span>Experiences with a sense of occasion</span></div></section>
<div class="wrap service-line"><span>Corporate events</span><span>Incentive travel</span><span>Curated group experiences</span><span>Event transportation</span></div>
<section class="section wrap" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your destination management company</p><h2>You set the purpose.<br>We bring it together.</h2></div><p>From the venue and experience to every guest movement, one considered plan.</p></div><div class="services"><article id="corporate-events"><p class="eyebrow">01</p><h3>Corporate events</h3><p>Meetings, holiday celebrations and client hospitality, shaped around your objectives.</p></article><article id="incentive-travel"><p class="eyebrow">02</p><h3>Incentive travel</h3><p>Reward your people with a destination worth looking forward to.</p></article><article id="group-experiences"><p class="eyebrow">03</p><h3>Curated group experiences</h3><p>Private tastings, team challenges and shared moments with a sense of occasion.</p></article><article id="event-transportation"><p class="eyebrow">04</p><h3>Event transportation</h3><p>Airport arrivals, executive transfers, group coaches and coordinated event shuttles.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section signature wrap" id="toronto-niagara"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our signature destinations</p><h2>Close to home.<br>Far from ordinary.</h2></div><p>Toronto’s after-dark energy. Niagara’s quiet indulgence. An occasion shaped around your group.</p></div><div class="signature-layout"><article class="signature-card" id="toronto"><div class="signature-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="object-position:center top" alt="Toronto skyline and CN Tower above a frozen Lake Ontario at sunset" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy"><div class="signature-caption"><h3>Toronto</h3><p>City lights. Festive nights. Something worth celebrating.</p></div></div><div class="signature-body"><p class="eyebrow">Winter experiences & private occasions</p><ul class="experience-list"><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto" data-interest="Winter experiences & Toronto Winter Market">Winter experiences & Toronto Winter Market</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto" data-interest="Corporate holiday events">Corporate holiday events</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto" data-interest="Team building experiences">Team building experiences</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto" data-interest="High tea">High tea</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto" data-interest="Private caviar tastings">Private caviar tastings</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto" data-interest="Whiskey tours">Whiskey tours</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto" data-interest="Custom scavenger hunts & themed experiences">Custom scavenger hunts & themed experiences</a></li></ul><a class="button ghost" href="#enquire" data-destination="Toronto">Curate your Toronto experience</a></div></article><article class="signature-card" id="niagara"><div class="signature-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Horseshoe Falls and rising mist beneath a dramatic evening sky" width="1000" height="750" loading="lazy"><div class="signature-caption"><h3>Niagara Falls</h3><p>The rush of the Falls. The luxury of slowing down.</p></div></div><div class="signature-body"><p class="eyebrow">Retreats, gatherings & tailored escapes</p><ul class="experience-list"><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls" data-interest="Niagara Parks Power Station">Niagara Parks Power Station</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls" data-interest="Private buyouts">Private buyouts</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls" data-interest="Spa & oasis experiences">Spa & oasis experiences</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls" data-interest="Meeting rooms & events">Meeting rooms & events</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls" data-interest="Custom curated scavenger hunts">Custom curated scavenger hunts</a></li><li><a href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls" data-interest="Themed experiences & dining">Themed experiences & dining</a></li></ul><a class="button ghost" href="#enquire" data-destination="Niagara Falls">Curate your Niagara experience</a></div></article></div></section>
<section class="dining-band"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="An elegant table set for a private group dining occasion" width="1000" height="700" loading="lazy"><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">A reason to gather</p><h2>The right setting.<br>The people who matter.</h2><p>A private tasting. A reward well earned. A celebration that becomes a shared memory.</p><a class="text-link" href="#enquire">Create your occasion</a></div></section>
